### Spec few-shot: negotiation against a competitor quote
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "We run a 50-person logistics firm in Southeast Asia and are looking for real-time fleet tracking. CompetitorX quoted us $20/vehicle/month. Can you match it?",
  "customer": {"email": "ops@swiftmove-logistics.sg"}
}

### Follow-up in the same session (replace with the session_id returned above)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Does it integrate with SAP Business One?",
  "session_id": "REPLACE_ME"
}

### Inbound lead webhook (form fill)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/webhooks/lead
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Interested in compliance training for 400 retail staff across Europe.",
  "customer": {"domain": "example-retail.eu"},
  "channel": "web_form"
}

### CRM record
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/crm/cust-swiftmove
